    {
      "id": "p0092-b005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This seems like a simple, unimportant message at first, until the player is literally given the menu options “Pick On” and “Don’t Pick On”. Picking on Loox will make him more difficult to defeat, while not picking on him will allow the player to spare him.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2893216,
          0.3064286,
          0.9107519,
          0.3821429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2893216,
          0.3064286,
          0.9107519,
          0.3821429
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "起初，这似乎只是句简单、无关紧要的话，直到菜单真的给出“Pick On”（欺负）和“Don’t Pick On”（不欺负）两个选项。欺负 Loox 会使他更难击败；不欺负他，则能让玩家饶恕他。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2933966,
          0.3035714,
          0.9076957,
          0.385
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
