    {
      "id": "p0092-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Toby pointed out in his translation notes that Loox’s line is actually a direct quote from the 1989 NES game, Monster Party. In this classic retro game, a pumpkin monster says “please don’t pick on me” when the player enters its lair.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2893216,
          0.39,
          0.9107519,
          0.4442857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.2893216,
          0.39,
          0.9107519,
          0.4442857
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Toby 在翻译备注中指出，Loox 的这句话直接出自 1989 年的 NES 游戏 Monster Party。在这款经典老游戏中，玩家走进一只南瓜怪物的巢穴时，它就会说“please don’t pick on me”。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": [
